Package: viroscape
Title: Ecological Predictors of Viral Genetic Divergence
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Frederick", "Au", email = "frederickau87@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Samantha", "Buchan", role = "ctb"))
Description: A reproducible platform for quantifying the relationship between
    ecological, land-use and climate variables and viral genetic divergence.
    Implements the full pipeline used in Au & Buchan (2026) for H5Nx
    haemagglutinin in Southeast Asia: sequence retrieval, alignment, consensus
    construction, substitution-model selection by information criterion,
    divergence-from-consensus at amino acid or nucleotide level, environmental
    data joining, and forward stepwise regression with collinearity and
    coefficient-stability guards. Includes a Shiny front-end for interactively
    swapping regions, distance metrics, substitution models and predictor sets.
